OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after children throw
OL,4,Abricks from Debenhams
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo boys have been arrested after
OL,7,Fbricks were thrown from the roof of the
OL,8,Fderelict Debenhams building in
OL,9,FNottingham city centre.
OL,11,FA security guard reported a group of
OL,12,Fchildren throwing bricks and other
OL,13,Fdebris on to the street at about 21:00
OL,14,FGMT on Monday.
OL,16,FNottinghamshire Police said a
OL,17,F14-year-old and 15-year-old were
OL,18,Farrested and bailed in connection with
OL,19,Fthe incident. The force said it was
OL,20,Fworking to identify others involved and
OL,21,Fmake further arrests.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
